# CODEOWNERS — operator review required for paths listed below.
#
# Combined with the ``main`` ruleset (which requires PRs for direct pushes),
# paths listed here need operator approval before a PR can land.
#
# Pattern order matters — later entries override earlier ones.

# Default: anyone can review. Specific gated paths below.
*  @chipi

# All workflow files — github-actions[bot] is a bypass actor on main, so
# any workflow with ``permissions: contents: write`` can push direct.
# Gate every workflow change behind operator review so a malicious or
# accidental PR can't add a new bypass-capable workflow.
.github/workflows/**                          @chipi

# CODEOWNERS itself — don't let it edit itself away.
.github/CODEOWNERS                            @chipi
